The bitmap font in M5Cardputer_WebRadio/NokiaFC.h was generated from
"Nokia Cellphone FC Small" by Zeh Fernando (2003), a freeware font.
The font file itself is not redistributed here; tools/make_nokia_font.py
regenerates the header from it.
